		(comment 1 "Meesho put-to-light, modular TX/RX rail")
		(comment 2 "Design notes below come from the 16 Oct review; replace with circuitry")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "- U7 ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N8 ONLY (no R / PSRAM variants: IO35-37 needed). Fab note required\n- Antenna at rear board edge, copper keep-out both layers\n- USB-C J6 on native USB IO19/IO20, USBLC6-2 ESD. BOOT (IO0) and RESET switches\n- UART0 IO43/IO44 debug header as backup\n- Status LED D9 SK6812-MINI-E, buzzer BZ1 footprint (DNP)\n- Address SW3 4-way DIP on resistor ladder -> one ADC pin\n- J4 2x10 logic-analyser header: 5 gates, 10 TSOP inputs, CAN TX, CAN RX, 3 GND\n- Indicator Q11-Q13 AO3400A low side, 1k gate, 100k pull-down, PWM <= 1 kHz\n- Avoid strapping IO0/3/45/46, USB IO19/20, UART0 IO43/44"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
